flowchart TB
    accTitle: The thread of an answer
    accDescr: Dennis writes a text in a thread of the chat. The answer to /help or an error goes into that thread at once. Free text goes to the control repository, and the pager keeps its thread while it waits. The answer of the control repository, a note, a failure or a proposal with its Confirm button, goes into the same thread. General, a text from before threads, a late answer and a thread that Telegram doesn't find get theirs in the main view.

    dennis["Dennis writes a text in a thread"]
    direct["`**/help** or an error: the answer goes into the thread at once`"]
    kept["`**👀** The text goes to the control repository, and the pager keeps its thread`"]
    answer["`**👍** The answer, or a proposal with ✅ Confirm, goes into the same thread`"]
    main["`**Main view**: General, a text from before threads, a late answer, or a thread that Telegram doesn't find`"]

    dennis --> direct
    dennis -- "free text" --> kept
    kept -- "the signed answer" --> answer
    answer -- "no thread kept, or Telegram refuses it" --> main

    classDef you fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef warn fill:#dc26262e,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    class dennis you
    class kept,direct bot
    class answer done
    class main warn
